{"unit_id":"Yuuichu__dsh-remote-picker#card-zh","repo":"Yuuichu/dsh-remote-picker","commit":"68f729e4dc62dd654eab95c6cf3574d056bf72ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-picker 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的远程目录选择器修复插件。它通过 bundle patch 禁用自动目录选择器，并直接装载浏览器内 browse 后端和对应界面，使手机或远程笔记本能够通过网页选择工作区目录。插件还会在启动完成后检查 directoryPicker 服务及其 browse 能力，并在未挂载或能力不符时记录警告。适合通过反向代理远程使用 DSH Web、无法操作主机原生对话框的用户；需要在 DSH Web profile 中安装并重启服务，不需要额外密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-24","lib/index.js:32-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuichu__dsh-remote-picker#card-en","repo":"Yuuichu/dsh-remote-picker","commit":"68f729e4dc62dd654eab95c6cf3574d056bf72ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-picker fixes workspace selection in remote DSH Web. Its bundle patch mounts an in-browser picker instead of the automatic picker, letting remote users choose folders on the page. A startup check warns if browse capability is missing. Install in the Web profile and restart DSH Web.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-24","lib/index.js:32-45"]}
