{"unit_id":"Yuuichu__dsh-remote-picker#feature-1","repo":"Yuuichu/dsh-remote-picker","commit":"68f729e4dc62dd654eab95c6cf3574d056bf72ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-picker 的功能「远程浏览器目录选择」：通过 bundle patch 禁用自动目录选择器，并装载浏览器内 browse 后端及客户端界面。用户可在远程 DSH Web 页面中浏览并选择工作区目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-24"]}
