{"unit_id":"Yuuichu__dsh-remote-picker#feature-3","repo":"Yuuichu/dsh-remote-picker","commit":"68f729e4dc62dd654eab95c6cf3574d056bf72ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-picker 的功能「保持启动自检不改动组件树」：自检只观察已装载的选择器，不修改 loader 树；因此它用于提示补丁未生效或能力不匹配，而不是运行时修复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-30","lib/index.js:32-45"]}
